  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/magic/fire/projectile-meteor-salvo-heavy-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You slow down up to six creatures of your choice in a 40-foot cube within range. Each target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be affected by this creations for the duration.\nAn affected target’s speed is halved, it takes a -2 penalty to AC and Dexterity saving throws, and it can’t use reactions. On its turn, it can use either an action or a bonus action, not both. Regardless of the creature’s abilities or mastercraft items, it can’t make more than one melee or ranged attack during its turn.\nIf the creature attempts to use a creation with a casting time of 1 action, roll a d20. On an 11 or higher, the creation doesn’t take effect until the creature’s next turn, and the creature must use its action on that turn to complete the spell. If it can’t, the creation is wasted.\nA creature affected by this creation makes another Wisdom saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a successful save, the effect ends for it.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
